24
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:54,560
One of the 9 countries of Demon Spirit Land,

25
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:55,600
the Sky Demon Country,

26
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:59,720
holds a competition between the Demon Generals every 300 years.

27
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:01,360
The victor

28
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:04,640
is given treasures and spells by the Demon Emperor.

29
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:07,560
But this competition

30
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,520
is different from before.

31
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,320
200 years ago,

32
00:02:12,240 --> 00:02:15,210
the war between the Sky Demon Country and the Fire Demon Country

33
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:17,040
caused heavy casualties on both sides.

34
00:02:18,080 --> 00:02:20,400
Our side even lost a Demon Commander-in-Chief

35
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:22,130
and a Vice Commander-in-Chief.

36
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:26,010
One of the Vice Commander-in-Chief filled the position of Commander-in-Chief.

37
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,240
For this reason,

38
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:31,570
there are currently 2 vacant Vice Commander-in-Chief positions.

39
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:34,440
Besides the rewards, this competition

40
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:37,590
is also a Vice Commander-in-Chief selection.

41
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:41,810
All the Demon Generals are eyeing these positions.

42
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:44,600
I needed 18 people with strong bodies

43
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:46,920
to refine the Eighteen Demonic Bodies.

44
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:49,360
Since you took Thirteen back,

45
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:51,560
I no longer have enough.

46
00:02:54,760 --> 00:02:56,000
But I believe

47
00:02:56,400 --> 00:02:57,920
that with your help,

48
00:02:58,400 --> 00:03:00,600
I can become a Vice Commander-in-Chief

49
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:03,880
even without the Eighteen Demonic Bodies.

50
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:05,890
Since I've agreed,

51
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:07,650
I will help you with all my strength.

52
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,610
But I have an urgent matter to deal with before.

53
00:03:09,480 --> 00:03:10,520
I'll come back

54
00:03:10,440 --> 00:03:11,640
in 2 months.

55
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:13,320
Fine,

56
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,080
it's settled then.

57
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,570
Ancestor !

58
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,720
The Ancestor is back !

59
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,760
It's the Ancestor !

60
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,160
The Ancestor has returned !

61
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,400
Ancestor !

62
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:28,720
The Ancestor is back !

63
00:03:29,760 --> 00:03:32,320
We welcome back the Ancestor.

64
00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:34,840
We welcome back the Ancestor !

65
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:36,640
This sight

66
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:39,800
reminds me of the old Soul Refining Sect.

67
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,320
Ancestor,

68
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,320
in your absence,

69
00:03:43,600 --> 00:03:47,050
all disciples have been cultivating diligently as you instructed.

70
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:50,000
We released our souls into the black clouds every day

71
00:03:49,880 --> 00:03:51,450
to temper them.

72
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:54,840
Now, we have both mastered Soul Flags and the spells you taught us.

73
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:55,920
Not bad.

74
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:11,880
Thirteen, you're awake !

75
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:18,240
Ancestor ?! You're safe !

76
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:21,840
Thirteen thanks the Ancestor for saving my life !

77
00:04:25,760 --> 00:04:27,290
I know what happened.

78
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:28,810
This past year,

79
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:29,810
you've worked hard.

80
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:33,840
When the Ancestor left and didn't return...

81
00:04:34,280 --> 00:04:35,810
I thought that as long as you're safe

82
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,200
I could die without regrets !

83
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,290
I don't have much time.

84
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:41,760
I must go to Sky Demon City in 2 months.

85
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:44,570
Since both of you are here today,

86
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,410
I have important things to teach you.

87
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,200
Soul Refining has 2 parts

88
00:04:48,870 --> 00:04:50,880
and Soul Refining was just the first one.

89
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:52,930
The second part is called Soul Extracting.

90
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:54,120
Ouyang Hua,

91
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:57,850
you will now continue to lead everyone in cultivating spells.

92
00:04:58,280 --> 00:04:59,320
But remember,

93
00:04:59,640 --> 00:05:01,770
you can only impart this one to direct disciples.

94
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:03,080
Disciple will remember.

95
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:03,960
Thirteen,

96
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:07,120
your cultivation is different from others.

97
00:05:07,640 --> 00:05:10,450
This is the next part of the Giant Demon Clan's body cultivation method.

98
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:12,000
Continue to cultivate it.

99
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:13,160
Thank you, Ancestor !

100
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:15,720
Ouyang Hua, Thirteen...

101
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,840
Disciples are listening.

102
00:05:18,080 --> 00:05:19,240
From now on,

103
00:05:19,680 --> 00:05:21,810
the Soul Refining Tribe will no longer lie low.

104
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:23,490
We will expand at full strength.

105
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:25,330
The next time I come back,

106
00:05:25,320 --> 00:05:27,810
I want a tribe with at least a million members.

107
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,570
Disciples will obey !

108
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:33,120
We will not disappoint the Ancestor !

109
00:05:34,280 --> 00:05:36,720
This trip to Sky Demon City will be dangerous.

110
00:05:37,280 --> 00:05:39,520
Although the Billion-Soul Flag isn't fully refilled yet,

111
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:41,850
I can still use it.

112
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,880
The Soul Refining Tribe

113
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:57,130
will have to rely on these other Soul Flags for protection.

114
00:06:06,880 --> 00:06:08,360
Take care of the tribe.

115
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:09,930
Dismissed.

116
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:10,850
Understood.

117
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:13,880
Ancestor...

118
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:16,520
Hu Pao, he...

119
00:06:17,400 --> 00:06:18,720
He might already be...

120
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:20,290
He's still alive.

121
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:20,880
What !?

122
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:22,360
If Hu Pao had died,

123
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:25,440
I would have sensed the souls of his Soul Flags.

124
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:29,410
I also swept Ancient Demon City with my Divine Sense

125
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:30,960
but didn't find a trace of him.

126
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:35,320
That must mean he's in some mysterious place.

127
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:37,690
With my current cultivation,

128
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:39,450
I'm unable to find him.

129
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:43,810
Demon Tower
Ancient Battleground
Sky Demon Country

130
00:06:42,760 --> 00:06:43,680
Master,

131
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:45,640
I have learned that

132
00:06:46,080 --> 00:06:48,760
he has reached Peak Late stage Soul Transformation

133
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:51,480
and will participate in the Demon General competition

134
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:53,800
alongside the Demon General of Ancient Demon City.

135
00:06:54,640 --> 00:06:57,890
Ta Jia's Scattered Devil

136
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:58,520
He actually cultivates pretty fast.

137
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,960
Keep an eye on him

138
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:03,400
but don't alert him.

139
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:07,480
How about the other candidates ?

140
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:11,360
None have shown signs of breakthroughs yet.

141
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:15,120
However, I have been training a new batch of demon guards.

142
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:17,080
Once they are fully trained,

143
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:19,640
they will assist in Master's return.

144
00:07:20,280 --> 00:07:22,450
Hu Pao pays respects to Benefactor !

145
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:24,400
You've made good progress lately.

146
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:28,200
Once you refine all the souls of this ancient battleground,

147
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:31,120
you will be strong enough to become Master's demon guard.

148
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:33,640
This is all thanks to Benefactor !

149
00:07:33,960 --> 00:07:35,170
You saved my life,

150
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:36,000
taught me spells,

151
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:38,090
and brought me here to cultivate.

152
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,930
Hu Pao will remember your kindness !

153
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:50,250
2 months later

154
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:05,130
Wang Lin...

155
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:07,330
Now tell me

156
00:08:07,280 --> 00:08:09,200
the real way to use the Blood Soul Pill.

157
00:08:10,880 --> 00:08:12,680
I will never tell you.

158
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:15,600
Now go ahead and kill me if you dare !

159
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,720
My cultivation hasn't reached Ascendant yet.

160
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:21,840
If I forcibly Soul Search her,

161
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:24,520
the slightest mistake might kill her.

162
00:08:25,480 --> 00:08:27,120
If you refuse to speak,

163
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:30,800
I can use restrictions to make you disappear from this world.

164
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:33,930
It's a fate worse than death.

165
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:35,560
Wang Lin,

166
00:08:35,680 --> 00:08:37,160
sooner or later,

167
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:39,400
my father will kill you, extract your soul,

168
00:08:39,160 --> 00:08:40,840
and imprison you in the Underworld !

169
00:08:41,080 --> 00:08:44,120
At that time you'll know what it means to be better off dead !

170
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:50,080
Agreeing to help Mo Lihai in the Demon General competition

171
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:52,160
was to rescue Thirteen

172
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:55,650
but it's also the fastest way for me to become a Demon General.

173
00:08:56,280 --> 00:08:58,440
But the Billion-Soul Flag is weakened,

174
00:08:58,880 --> 00:09:00,320
the Blood Soul Pills are useless,

175
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:03,410
and Situ's 3 killing spells need to be used sparingly...

176
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:07,010
That means I need to rely on the Celestial Slaughter Art.

177
00:09:07,680 --> 00:09:10,520
The Life Seals refined by the Celestial Slaughter Art

178
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:12,600
can be used offensively.

179
00:09:12,680 --> 00:09:14,690
They're hard to defend against.

180
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:17,360
I have killed many living beings

181
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:19,920
but I have only refined a couple Life Seals.

182
00:09:20,400 --> 00:09:22,640
The few times I refined a Life Seal

183
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,600
appear to be random.

184
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:27,240
What's the logic behind them ?

185
00:09:27,880 --> 00:09:28,920
Brother Wang,

186
00:09:29,760 --> 00:09:31,120
the time has come.

187
00:09:31,280 --> 00:09:32,520
Let's go.

188
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:36,170
Sky Demon City

189
00:09:37,280 --> 00:09:39,650
Sky Demon City

190
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:51,400
Welcome, Demon General Mo !

191
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,920
After 30 years...

192
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:54,680
I'm finally back.

193
00:10:08,640 --> 00:10:10,600
We pay respects to the Demon General.

194
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,040
Stand up !

195
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:16,800
This is my good friend, Vice-General Wang.

196
00:10:16,560 --> 00:10:18,040
When you meet him,

197
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:19,640
treat him like me.

198
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:20,880
We pay respects to Vice-General Wang !

199
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:22,680
Brother Wang,

200
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:23,440
please.

201
00:10:26,280 --> 00:10:29,170
Imperial Capital
Sky Demon City

202
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:28,880
Blood Demon Wine, come take a look !

203
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:30,400
This thing looks beautiful.

204
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:31,240
Let's go take a look !

205
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:32,560
Blood Demon Wine !

206
00:10:32,880 --> 00:10:34,280
So many river lanterns !

207
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:37,960
Take care.

208
00:10:58,680 --> 00:11:01,170
Isn't this the renowned Demon General Mo ?

209
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:03,130
Who is that person beside him ?

210
00:11:02,960 --> 00:11:04,200
I don't know.

211
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,760
But in previous competitions

212
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:08,320
each Demon General was able to have one helper.

213
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,480
Since Demon General Mo chose him,

214
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:13,240
he must be special.

215
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,640
He is no ordinary soldier.

216
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:18,640
The capital, Sky Demon City, is divided into inner and outer city.

217
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:22,720
The Tian, De, Xuan, and Huang districts form the inner city.

218
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:27,200
The Yu, Zhou, Hong, and Huãng districts form the outer city.

219
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:29,280
The inner city is for officials

220
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,800
and the outer city for the military.

221
00:11:31,200 --> 00:11:34,920
I live in the Hong district.

222
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:37,530
If Brother Wang doesn't mind,

223
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:39,280
please stay at my residence.

224
00:11:39,680 --> 00:11:41,690
I'll follow what you've arranged for me.

225
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:43,930
It's been a while since I was last here

226
00:11:43,960 --> 00:11:47,040
but the capital is as bustling as ever.

227
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:13,400
If I want to become a Vice Commander-in-Chief,

228
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:15,600
we need to be wary of 2 people.

229
00:12:16,960 --> 00:12:18,240
The first

230
00:12:18,360 --> 00:12:21,810
is Mo Fei, the one who guards our border with the Fire Demon Country.

231
00:12:21,680 --> 00:12:23,600
This person is famous on the battlefields

232
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:26,080
and is the strongest among the Demon Generals.

233
00:12:27,960 --> 00:12:29,170
The second person

234
00:12:29,160 --> 00:12:30,400
is named Shi Xiao.

235
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:32,400
He also guards the border.

236
00:12:32,880 --> 00:12:35,450
We've been at odds with each other for years.

237
00:12:35,280 --> 00:12:37,370
His spell, the Six Finger Demon Sword,

238
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:38,640
is unpredictable.

239
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:49,600
Speak of the devil.

240
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:53,570
Shi Xiao
Demon General
Rank 200 000 Demonic Energy
(Peak Late stage Soul Transformation)

241
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:29,280
Thank you.

242
00:13:30,560 --> 00:13:32,530
Guarding the border for 100 years

243
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:34,730
doesn't seem to have made you any stronger.

244
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:39,000
Outsider,

245
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,280
what's your name ?

246
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:42,050
His name is Wang Lin,

247
00:13:41,800 --> 00:13:43,200
he's my Junior Brother.

248
00:13:44,280 --> 00:13:46,160
It seems Junior Brother had good fortune,

249
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:48,240
your cultivation has improved.

250
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:54,480
Back then, Master helped Chen Tao conceal his Ascendant cultivation

251
00:13:54,760 --> 00:13:56,770
in order to enter this place.

252
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,810
With his strength,

253
00:13:58,680 --> 00:14:00,650
how could he be so severely injured ?

254
00:14:00,560 --> 00:14:02,760
He even fell out of Ascendant.

255
00:14:02,960 --> 00:14:05,050
Be careful of the Da Lou Sword Sect.

256
00:14:05,000 --> 00:14:06,000
They're the ones

257
00:14:06,160 --> 00:14:07,560
that injured me.

258
00:14:29,950 --> 00:14:31,790
This person is named Mo Lihai

259
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:33,400
and has 3 powerful spells.

260
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:35,840
The first is the Ten Collapse Battle Intent,

261
00:14:36,360 --> 00:14:38,440
the second is the Hundred Waves Demon Sea,

262
00:14:39,560 --> 00:14:40,800
and the third...

263
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:43,010
was personally taught by the Demon Emperor

264
00:14:42,880 --> 00:14:44,850
and is immeasurably powerful.

265
00:14:45,160 --> 00:14:46,970
If I were at my prime,

266
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:47,970
I could've killed him.

267
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:50,810
What about your Junior Brother ?

268
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:52,840
He's strong.

269
00:14:53,640 --> 00:14:55,400
At Middle stage Soul Transformation

270
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:57,810
he was able to fight Ascendant cultivators.

271
00:14:57,880 --> 00:14:59,610
Now that his cultivation has increased,

272
00:15:00,040 --> 00:15:01,880
I'd rather not provoke him.

