316
00:18:03,660 --> 00:20:08,210
The Celestial Slaughter Art has 2 functions: both offensive and defensive. By killing and refining strands of slaughter energy, Wang Lin can create Life Seals that he can use defensively. The Life Seals can be converted at anytime into strands of slaughter energy to be used offensively.

2 things were cut in the episode: some unnecessary details from Yao Xixue's interrogation and Wang Lin's infatuation with the zither music on the boat.

During the interrogation, Wang Lin saw through Yao Xixue's suicide attempt. She had used life energy to form a needle in her throat to kill herself. He opens her mouth and takes the needle out.
Yao Xixue's hatred makes her enter a state of understanding of the Dao. To prevent her from having a breakthrough, Wang Lin removes her clothes and uses restrictions to stimulate her body and prevent her from having a clear mind.

Later in the episode Wang Lin originally had 3 days to kill before entering the prison so he goes by the river and listens to the zither music of the woman on the boat and remembers Li Muwan.
He then drinks while staring at the night sky. I hope this part gets adapted later.

A jar of high quality wine from Ancient Demon City was placed next to Wang Lin. He would occasionally pick up the jar and take a drink. The bleakness of his shadow gradually affected his body, and his loneliness seemed to fuse with the moonlight that imprinted on his body and soul…
“I, Wang Lin, began learning the Dao at the age of 16, but I have long forgotten exactly how long I have cultivated for…” Wang Lin picked up the jar and took a big gulp. The wine leaked out from the corner of his mouth and dripped on his clothes.
Wang Lin looked at the starlight in the sky and revealed a hint of loneliness.
“Cultivators walk against the heavens and are destined to be forever lonely…”
There were no sounds, but Wang Lin could still faintly hear the zither music. He wiped the wine from the corner of his mouth and muttered, “Being lonely for life gives one the heart to seek the Dao… But then how many people can truly savor this feeling of loneliness? Just like this wine, it is spicy when it enters the mouth, but then it turns into warmth once it enters the body…”
Under the starlight and moonlight, a solitary shadow was drinking wine and contemplating life…
“I don’t know how those cultivators who have cultivated for over ten thousand years endured those ten thousand years. But I know that if one doesn’t have at least a tiny bit of emotion, they are only cultivating their self-created Dao and not the Dao of the heavens!”
“The heavens and earth are inhumane. Cultivating is about going against the heavens, but if a cultivator is also heartless, than they are also inhumane. Using an inhumane heart to cultivate the heaven’s inhumane Dao, how can that be considered going against the heavens? That is merely following the will of the heavens.
“Since ancient times, those that followed the will of the heavens were favored by the heavens, but in truth they were merely insects! My Dao doesn’t follow the will of the heavens, I follow my heart to walk against the heavens. I don’t seek to be immortal, I seek to get rid of my status as an insect. That is what it means to rebel!”
